XLOOKUP One sheet
=XLOOKUP(E2, A2:A100, B2:B100)
=XLOOKUP(V5,N:N,I:I)
=XLOOKUP(V5,N:N,F:F)

Double sheet
=XLOOKUP(V5, Sheet2!N:N, Sheet2!I:I)
=XLOOKUP(F2,Sheet1!I:I,Sheet1!E:E)

Error Fix:
=XLOOKUP(E2, A2:A100, B2:B100,0),

--
XLOOKUP ALL DATA
=XLOOKUP(lookup_value, lookup_column, entire_data_table)
=XLOOKUP(B3,B1:B9,C1:K9)

--

XLOOKUP MULTIPLE RECORDS
=XLOOKUP(SELECT CELL+SELECT COLUMN AND PRES F4BUTTON + SELECT REST ALL COLUMN AND F4 + )
=XLOOKUP(A11,$A$1:$A$8,$B$1:$I$8))

--

XLOOKUP+TRANSPOSE
=TRANSPOSE(XLOOKUP(B10,A1:A8,B1:G8))
ALL DATA WILL SHOW VERTICALLY.
USING TRANSPOSE

--

XLOOKUP MULTIPLE COLUMN
=XLOOKUP(A11,A1:A8,CHOOSE({1,2,3},B1:B8,E1:E8,I1:I8))
Using CHOOSE


XLOOKUP  MULTIPLE COLUMN
=CHOOSECOLS(XLOOKUP(A14,A1:A8,A1:I8),4,5,9)
Using CHOOSECOLS

--

MULTIPLE LOOKUP VALUES
=XLOOKUP(A14&B14,A1:A8&B1:B8,C1:I8)
Using &

--

TWO WAY X LOOKUP
=XLOOKUP(A11,A1:A8,XLOOKUP(B10,A1:I1,A1:I8))
AUOMATION: CHANGE YOUR HEADNING VALUE WILL BE CHANGE 

--

NESTED LOOKUP (MULTIPLE TABLE)
=XLOOKUP(A11,A1:A8,B1:I8,XLOOKUP(A11,A16:A22,B16:I22,XLOOKUP(A11,A24:A31,B24:I31)))
NEED TO USE MULTIPLE XLOOKUP AND SELECT ONE BY ONE ALL TABLE

